{"about_the_game":"<strong>A troop-clash strategy game. Choose your hero, command minions, crush enemy formations! Inspired by Heroes of Might &amp; Magic and Hero's Hour. Multiple races with national styles like Huaxia and France. Random maps = unique fun every game! Endless development &amp; combat!  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/541c866d832d082dd3ff468b1b33ab4f.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.poster.avif?t=1754712211\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.webm?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/595873d63303751e0ac5e0d59a49e535.mp4?t=1754712211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Recruit legendary heroes with unique skills and distinct personalities! Each hero possesses powerful, unique abilities and growth paths. As the soul of your civilization, they lead the era, and their decisions profoundly impact the rise and fall of your empire.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/4c5afcd0c20ec50e910e7c9891509d5c.avif?t=1754712211\" width=615 height=55 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/extras/3116deb95e5946f7384af16ada5514ac.poster.avif?t=1754712211\" width=614 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset